          {
            "title": "Local scope",
            "id": 86990,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las variables creadas dentro de una función tienen un <strong>alcance local</strong>, como <code>bonus</code> aquí.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bonus&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>bonus</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las variables creadas dentro de una función tienen un <strong>alcance local</strong>. Asigna a <code>bonus</code> el valor <code>100</code> para que el código imprima <code>2000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>bonus</code> seguido de <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Local scope 2",
            "id": 86991,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con un alcance local, solo podemos acceder o actualizar la variable dentro de la función que la creó. Intenta establecer <code>bonus</code> a <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>bonus</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Solo puedes acceder o actualizar una variable local dentro de la función que la creó.</p><p>Actualiza <code>bonus</code> para que el código muestre <code>2100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>bonus</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Error",
            "id": 86992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si intentamos acceder o actualizar la variable fuera del bloque de la función, como aquí con <code>bonus</code>, obtendremos un error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'bonus' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>bonus</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Local scope",
            "id": 87035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuándo tiene una variable un ámbito local?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cuando lo creamos dentro de un bloque de función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Las variables siempre tienen un ámbito local</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cuando lo creamos dentro de un bloque de función.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creas <code>title</code> fuera de todas las funciones y <code>message</code> dentro de <code>greet()</code>. ¿Cuál tiene alcance local?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>message</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tanto <code>title</code> como <code>message</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>message</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Local scope 2",
            "id": 87036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué significa que una variable tenga un ámbito local?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No podemos acceder o actualizarlo fuera de la función donde fue creado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Podemos acceder a él desde cualquier parte del código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No podemos acceder o actualizarlo fuera de la función donde fue creado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acceder a una variable local fuera de la función que la creó provoca un error.</p><p>Llamas a una función que crea <code>discount = 5</code> y luego pruebas <code>print(discount)</code> fuera de ella. ¿Qué ocurre?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python muestra un error porque <code>discount</code> es local a la función.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python muestra <code>5</code> porque la función creó la variable.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python muestra <code>None</code> porque la variable está fuera de la función.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python muestra un error porque <code>discount</code> es local a la función.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error",
            "id": 87037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué sucede cuando intentamos acceder a una variable de ámbito local fuera de la función que la creó?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Obtenemos un error</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No pasa nada, podemos acceder a ello</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Obtenemos un error.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Intentar acceder a una variable local fuera de la función que la creó provoca un error.</p><p>Una función crea <code>total</code>. ¿Qué cambio permite que la función muestre ese valor sin un error de alcance?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mueve <code>print(total)</code> dentro del bloque de código de la función.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Llama primero a la función y luego usa <code>print(total)</code> fuera de ella.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Cambia el nombre de <code>total</code> solo en la llamada externa a <code>print()</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mueve <code>print(total)</code> dentro del bloque de código de la función.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Local scope",
            "id": 87038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la variable <code>discount</code>, que tiene un alcance local dentro de la función <code>apply_discount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"final_price = apply_discount(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(final_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"30\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>discount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Local scope 2",
            "id": 87039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Actualiza la variable <code>discount</code> a <code>10</code> dentro del ámbito local de <code>apply_discount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"final_price = apply_discount(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(final_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>discount = 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Error",
            "id": 87040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica una línea para imprimir el mensaje de saludo sin acceder a la variable <code>greeting</code> fuera de su ámbito local de la función <code>greet_user</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{greeting}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi Amy!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>f</code>, <code>\"Hi {user}!\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variable <code>greeting</code> es local a <code>greet_user</code>, así que no puedes usarla aquí fuera. Crea una línea que imprima <code>Hi Amy!</code> por sí sola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{greeting}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{greeting} {user}!&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Hi {name}!&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi Amy!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>f</code>, <code>\"Hi {user}!\"</code> y finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 9778,
        "title": "Ámbito global",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Global scope 1",
            "id": 86994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las variables creadas fuera de un bloque de función tienen un <strong>alcance global</strong>, como <code>shipping</code> aquí.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>shipping</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una variable creada fuera de una función tiene un <strong>alcance global</strong>, por lo que la función puede leerla. Crea <code>shipping</code> como <code>10</code> para imprimir <code>64</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"cart\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>shipping</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Global access",
            "id": 86995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con un alcance global, podemos <strong>acceder</strong> de manera segura a la variable en cualquier parte del código, como hicimos con <code>shipping</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>shipping</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Global scope 2",
            "id": 86996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Todas las variables tienen un alcance global, excepto aquellas creadas dentro de funciones, como <code>player_1</code> aquí.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>player_1</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un bloque <code>if</code> no es una función, así que <code>player_1</code> mantiene un alcance global. Asígnale <code>\"Mario\"</code> para imprimir <code>Player 1: Mario</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"single_player\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Luigi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>player_1</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Access after creating",
            "id": 86997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Incluso con un alcance global, es importante que solo podamos acceder a las variables después de crearlas, como aquí con <code>character</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(character)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>character = \"Mario\"</code> seguido de <code>print(character)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Incluso una variable global solo puede usarse después de crearla.</p><p>Guarda <code>\"Mario\"</code> en <code>character</code>, copia su valor en <code>message</code> y luego muestra <code>message</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"character\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message = &quot;character&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(&quot;message&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>character = \"Mario\"</code> seguido de <code>message = character</code> y finalmente <code>print(message)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Global scope 1",
            "id": 87041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué variables tienen un alcance global?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Variables creadas fuera del bloque de una función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Todas las variables</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Variables creadas fuera del bloque de una función.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las variables creadas fuera del bloque de una función tienen alcance global.</p><p>La línea <code>theme = \"dark\"</code> aparece antes de cualquier definición de función. ¿Qué alcance tiene <code>theme</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Alcance global</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Alcance local</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Alcance de parámetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir Alcance global.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Global access",
            "id": 87042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Desde dónde podemos acceder a una variable con un alcance global?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Desde cualquier parte del código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo dentro de funciones</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Desde cualquier parte del código.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puedes acceder a una variable global desde cualquier parte del código.</p><p>Con <code>tax = 5</code> global, una función devuelve <code>price + tax</code>. ¿Qué devuelve si <code>price</code> es <code>10</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>15</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code>, porque la función ignora las variables externas.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un error, porque <code>tax</code> se creó fuera de la función.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Questions: Global scope 2",
            "id": 87043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipo de alcance tienen las variables creadas dentro de condicionales y bucles?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Local</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Global, porque no se crean dentro de funciones</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir Local.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Los condicionales y los bucles no crean un nuevo alcance local en Python.</p><p>Un bucle <code>while</code> de nivel superior crea <code>attempts = 1</code> en su bloque. ¿Qué alcance tiene <code>attempts</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Alcance global, porque el bucle no crea un nuevo alcance</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Alcance local, porque la asignación está indentada dentro del bucle</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No tiene alcance hasta que termina el bucle</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Alcance global, porque el bucle no crea un nuevo alcance.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access after creating",
            "id": 87044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuándo podemos acceder por primera vez a una variable, independientemente del ámbito?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo después de que lo creemos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Antes o después de crearlo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo después de que lo creemos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Independientemente del alcance, solo podemos acceder a una variable después de crearla.</p><p>¿Qué orden muestra <code>10</code> sin un error?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Primero <code>score = 10</code>, luego <code>print(score)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Primero <code>print(score)</code>, luego <code>score = 10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo <code>print(score)</code>, porque imprimir crea la variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Primero <code>score = 10</code>, luego <code>print(score)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Global scope 1",
            "id": 87045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea <code>rent</code> fuera de la función, para que tenga un alcance global.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rent = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(groceries)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Total: \" /><text value=\"{rent + groceries}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rent: \" /><text value=\"{rent}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rent: 1000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Total: 1300\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>rent</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea <code>rent</code> fuera de la función para que esta y la sentencia de visualización externa puedan leerla. Asígnale <code>1000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rent = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(groceries)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Total: \" /><text value=\"{rent + groceries}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rent: \" /><text value=\"{rent}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rent: 1000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Total: 1300\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>rent</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Global access",
            "id": 87046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accede a la variable global <code>rent</code> dentro de la función.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rent = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(groceries)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Total \" /><text value=\"{rent + groceries}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Rent \" /><text value=\"{rent}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_spendings(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Rent 1000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Total 1300\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>rent</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Global scope 2",
            "id": 87047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la variable global <code>discount</code>, luego muéstrala fuera del bucle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Discount: \" /><text value=\"{discount}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Price: \" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"103\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Price: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>discount = 10</code> seguido de <code>print(f\"Discount: {discount}\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un bucle <code>for</code> no es una función, por lo que <code>discount</code> sigue siendo global.</p><p>Créala con <code>10</code> y muéstrala tras el bucle para obtener <code>Discount: 10</code> y <code>Price: 80</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Discount: \" /><text value=\"{discount}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Price: \" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount = 20\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(discount)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Price: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>discount = 10</code> seguido de <code>print(f\"Discount: {discount}\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Access after creating",
            "id": 87048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea y muestra la variable <code>tries_left</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tries_left = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tries_left)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(levels)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>tries_left = 2</code> seguido de <code>print(tries_left)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la variable global <code>tries_left</code> como <code>2</code> y luego muéstrala para que el código imprima <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tries_left = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tries_left)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(levels)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tries_left = 3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>tries_left = 2</code> seguido de <code>print(tries_left)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
